Lipa's vocals range from [[F♯ (musical note)|F{{music|sharp}}<sub>3</sub>]] to [[B (musical note)|B<sub>4</sub>]].<ref name="MN" /> The [[middle eight]] includes a [[Blondie (band)|Blondie]]-influenced rap, where Lipa exerts her British accent, before she performs an [[a cappella]] ahead of the final chorus.<ref name="Apple Music" /><ref name="Slant Rank" /> "Levitating" has many [[outer space]] references,<ref name="Melodic" /><ref name="Gay Times" /><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.insider.com/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia-review-first-listen-2020-3|title=Review: Dua Lipa's 'Future Nostalgia' is an instant pop classic|work=[[Insider Inc.|Insider]]|last1=Larocca|first1=Courteney|last2=Ahlgrim|first2=Callie|date=27 March 2020|access-date=31 July 2020|url-status=live|archive-url=https://archive.today/20200623192321/https://www.insider.com/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia-review-first-listen-2020-3|archive-date=23 June 2020}}</ref> using an exaggerated metaphor of love as a spaceship to transmit radiant euphoria and happiness.<ref name="Slant Rank" /><ref name="Nylon">{{cite web|url=https://www.nylon.com/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia-review|title=Dua Lipa's 'Future Nostalgia' Is Her Try At Pop Futurism|work=Nylon|last=D'Souza|first=Shaad|date=26 March 2020|access-date=31 July 2020|url-status=live|archive-url=https://archive.today/20200726013252/https://www.nylon.com/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia-review|archive-date=26 July 2020}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://jenesaispop.com/2020/03/30/387493/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia/|title=Dua Lipa / Future Nostalgia|work=Jenesaispop|language=es|last=Bardají|first=Jordi|date=30 March 2020|access-date=31 July 2020|url-status=live|archive-url=https://archive.today/20200731155519/https://jenesaispop.com/2020/03/30/387493/dua-lipa-future-nostalgia/|archive-date=31 July 2020}}</ref> Lyrically, the song sees Lipa exposing her feelings for a significant other and singing about moments with them in which she is her best self.<ref name="Slant Rank" /><ref na